{"about_the_game":"A first-person, psychological horror game, The Lodge takes players on a journey into the horrors of a twisted mind.<br />\r\nSet in 1967, Owen Thomas - recently returned from Vietnam - wakes up to find himself in a secluded lodge. Using what few resources he has, he must figure out what\u2019s real before it\u2019s too late. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver the past three months we have been making a game and this is the fruit of our labor. The teams hard work and dedication to this game brought us together and made for some pretty good fun. We know it needs work, and we ain't promising a release date anytime soon. Enjoy the game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nPuzzle Solving<br />\r\nIn-depth Story<br />\r\nImmersive Environment<br />\r\nMystery<br />\r\nSuspense<br />\r\nChase Sequences<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWarning: This Game contains flashing lights and disturbing content. This is a work of fiction and any events related to real life events or people is completely coincidental.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1507650?t=1615315236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1507650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1615315236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1507650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1615315236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1507650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1615315236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Lodge contains flashing lights and disturbing content. This is a work of fiction and any events related to real life events or people is completely coincidental."},"detailed_description":"A first-person, psychological horror game, The Lodge takes players on a journey into the horrors of a twisted mind.<br />\r\nSet in 1967, Owen Thomas - recently returned from Vietnam - wakes up to find himself in a secluded lodge. Using what few resources he has, he must figure out what\u2019s real before it\u2019s too late. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver the past three months we have been making a game and this is the fruit of our labor. The teams hard work and dedication to this game brought us together and made for some pretty good fun. We know it needs work, and we ain't promising a release date anytime soon. Enjoy the game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nPuzzle Solving<br />\r\nIn-depth Story<br />\r\nImmersive Environment<br />\r\nMystery<br />\r\nSuspense<br />\r\nChase Sequences<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWarning: This Game contains flashing lights and disturbing content. This is a work of fiction and any events related to real life events or people is completely coincidental.","developers":["Mad Mountain Studios","Professor David Lopez","Jordan Zimmer - Executive Producer","Miles Zimmer - Producer","Murphy Buck - Creative Director","Dylan Rose - Art Lead","Joshua Mariscal - Design Lead","Scott Hawley - Engineering Lead","Kat Underhill - Writing Lead","Cassidy Robideaux - Audio Lead","Avery Craig - Design Team","Angel Ramirez - Design Team","Drake Rose - Engineer","Jonpaul Gee - Engineer","Sydney Fonderie - Engineer","Alex Douglass - Writer","Alexander Doyle - Composer","Bennett Skolnick - Composer","Bradley Jardine - Sound Designer/Composer","Red Skies Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1507650/header.jpg?t=1615315236","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Warning: This game contains flashing lights and disturbing content. This is a work of fiction and any events related to real life events or people is completely coincidental.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements